&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering Reliability&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program Ownership: &lt;/strong&gt;Lead end-to-end chaos engineering, from test planning and execution to results publication.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Execution &amp;amp; Readiness: &lt;/strong&gt;Coordinate readiness reviews, go/no-go decisions, and safe execution of production resilience tests.&lt;/p&gt;
